  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Build a React Native app using Expo.",
    "Do NOT use HTML, Tailwind, or Shadcn. Use React Native components (View, Text, Image, ScrollView, TouchableOpacity, FlatList) and StyleSheet.create().",
    "App must support RTL (Arabic) natively. DO NOT hardcode left/right paddings/margins. Use 'marginStart', 'marginEnd', 'paddingStart', 'paddingEnd'.",
    "Primary brand color is #8833FF.",
    "All interactive components MUST have testID props corresponding to their functionality (e.g. testID='login-button').",
    "Implement bottom tab navigation utilizing the specified active/inactive colors.",
    "Use safe area insets to handle notches and navigation bars.",
    "Do NOT use external images other than the ones provided in the media section of this JSON. Create realistic mock data using these URLs."
  ]
